<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Idris six-mth net falls 64 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Idris six-mth net falls 64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   3.98   vs	  11.19</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  0.7    vs	   2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   128.11   vs	 123.40</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     9.01   vs	  17.92</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.25   vs  less   0.02</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of company is Idris Hydraulics (M) Bhd. It is involved in timber, property, insurance services among other activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
